OL,5,G2100 The Frontier: Discovery
OL,6,     FExploring events and folklore of
OL,7,     Fthe American frontier that are now
OL,8,     Fembedded in culture. As former
OL,9,     FBritish Colonies on the east coast
OL,10,     Fbecame the USA, sights were set on
OL,11,     Fwhat lay west. (Ep1/6)
OL,12,G2200 The Frontier: Under Siege
OL,13,     FAs the United States advanced
OL,14,     Fwest, what appeared to be empty
OL,15,     Fterrain was in fact a richly
OL,16,     Finhabited landscape of indigenous
OL,17,     Fpeoples who would not surrender
OL,18,     Ftheir lands without a fight. (Ep2)
